{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-21-1","title":"Revelation 21:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 A new heaven and a new earth. 10 The heavenly Jerusalem, with a full description thereof. 23 She needs no sun, the glory of God being her light. 24 The kings of the earth bring their riches unto her.</p>\n<p>a new. 5; Isa 65:17-19; 66:22; 2Pe 3:13 for. 20:11 and there. 13:1; Isa 27:1; 57:20; Da 7:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-2","title":"Revelation 21:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>I. 1:1,4,9 the holy. 3:12; Ps 48:1-3; 87:3; Isa 1:21; 52:1; Jer 31:23; Heb 11:10; 12:22 Heb 13:14 coming. 10; Ga 4:25,26 as. 19:7,8; Ps 45:9-14; Isa 54:5; 61:10; 62:4; Joh 3:29; 2Co 11:2 Eph 5:25-27,30-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-3","title":"Revelation 21:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>a great. 10:4,8; 12:10 Behold. 7:15; Le 26:11,12; 1Ki 8:27; 2Ch 6:18; Isa 12:6; Eze 37:27; 43:7 Joh 1:14; 14:23; 2Co 6:16 they shall. 7; Ge 17:7,8; Jer 31:33; 32:38; Zec 13:9; 2Co 6:18; Heb 8:10; 11:16 God himself. Zec 8:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-4","title":"Revelation 21:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>God shall. 7:17; Isa 25:8 no. 20:14; 22:3; Isa 25:8; Ho 13:14; 1Co 15:26,54-58; Heb 2:14,15 neither sorrow. Isa 30:19; 35:10; 60:20; 61:3; 65:18,19; Jer 31:13 the former. 1; Ps 144:4; Mt 24:35; 1Co 7:31; 2Co 6:17; 2Pe 3:10; 1Jo 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-5","title":"Revelation 21:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>that sat. 4:2,9; 5:1; 20:11 Behold. Isa 42:9; 43:19; 2Co 5:17 Write. 1:11,19 these. 19:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-6","title":"Revelation 21:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>It is. 16:17 I am. 1:8,11,17; 22:13 I will. 7:17; 22:17; Isa 12:3; 55:1-3; Joh 4:10,14; 7:37,38 the fountain. Ps 36:9; Jer 2:13; Joe 3:18 freely. Ho 14:4; Ro 3:24; 8:32; 1Co 2:12; 3:5,12,21; 1Jo 5:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-7","title":"Revelation 21:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>overcometh. 2:11,17,25 inherit. 1Sa 2:8; Pr 3:35; Isa 65:9; Mt 19:29; 25:34; Mr 10:17; 1Co 3:21-23 1Pe 1:3,4; 3:9 all things. or, these things. and I. 3; Zec 8:8; Ro 8:15-17; Heb 8:10; 1Jo 3:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-8","title":"Revelation 21:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>the fearful. De 20:8; Jud 7:3; Isa 51:12; 57:11; Mt 8:26; 10:28; Lu 12:4-9 Joh 12:42,43; 1Pe 3:14,15; 1Jo 5:4,5,10 and the. 22:15; Mal 3:5; 1Co 6:9,10; Ga 5:19-21; Eph 5:5,6; 1Ti 1:9,10 Heb 12:24; 13:4; 1Jo 3:15 and idolaters. 1Co 10:20,21 and all. 2:2; Pr 19:5,9; Isa 9:15; Joh 8:44; 2Th 2:9; 1Ti 4:2; 1Jo 2:22 the lake. 19:20; 20:14,15 which is. 20:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-9","title":"Revelation 21:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>which. 15:1-7; 16:1-17 the Lamb's. 2; 19:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-10","title":"Revelation 21:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>he carried. 1:10; 4:2; 17:3; 1Ki 18:12; 2Ki 2:16; Eze 3:14; 8:3; 11:1,24; 40:1-3 Ac 8:39; 2Co 12:2-4 that. 2; Eze 40:1-49; 48:15-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-11","title":"Revelation 21:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the glory. 22,23; 22:5; Isa 4:5; 60:1,2,19,20; Eze 48:35 her. 19; Eze 1:26; 28:13,14,16 clear. 18; 4:6; 22:1; Job 28:17; Eze 1:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-12","title":"Revelation 21:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>a wall. 17-20; Ezr 9:9; Ne 12:27; Ps 51:18; 122:7 twelve gates. 21,25; Isa 54:12; 60:18; Eze 48:31-34 twelve angels. Mt 18:10; Lu 15:10; 16:22; Heb 1:14 and names. 7:4-8; Nu 2:2-32; Ac 26:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-13","title":"Revelation 21:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Eze 48:31-34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-14","title":"Revelation 21:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>foundations. 19-21; Isa 54:11; Heb 11:10 and in. 18:20; Mt 10:2-4; 16:18; 1Co 3:10,11; Ga 2:9; Eph 2:20; 3:5; 4:11 Jude 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-15","title":"Revelation 21:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>a golden. 11:1,2; Ex 40:3-5; Eze 41:1-5; Zec 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-16","title":"Revelation 21:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>four square.The square form of this city probably denotes its stability; while its vast dimensions, being 1,500 miles on each side, are emblematical of magnificence, and of its capability of containing all the multitude of inhabitants which should ever enter it, however immense or innumerable.</p>\n<p>Eze 48:17,18,20,35 twelve. Eze 48:8-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-17","title":"Revelation 21:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>an. 7:4; 14:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-18","title":"Revelation 21:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>was of. 11,19 like. 11,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-19","title":"Revelation 21:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>the foundations. Job 28:16-19; Pr 3:15; Isa 54:11,12 sapphire. Ex 28:17-21; 29:10-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-21","title":"Revelation 21:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>the twelve. 12; 17:4; Mt 13:45,46 every several.This may denote, that every thing will be superlatively glorious, beyond all comparison with any thing ever seen on earth.</p>\n<p>pure. 18; 17:4; 18:16; 22:2; 1Ki 6:20; Isa 60:17,18 as it. 11,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-22","title":"Revelation 21:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>I saw. 4,5; 1Ki 8:27; 2Ch 2:6; 6:18; Isa 66:1; Joh 4:23 the Lord. 1:8; 4:8; 11:17; 15:3; 16:7,14; 19:15 the Lamb. Joh 2:19-21; 10:30; Col 1:19; 2:9; Heb 9:1-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-23","title":"Revelation 21:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>the city. 11; 22:5; Isa 24:23; 60:19,20 for. 11; 18:1; Isa 2:10,19,21; Hab 3:3; Mt 16:27; Mr 8:38; Joh 17:24 Ac 22:11 the Lamb. Lu 2:32; Joh 1:4,9,14,18; 5:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-21-24","title":"Revelation 21:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>the nations. 22:2; De 32:43; Ps 22:27; Isa 2:2; 52:15; 55:5,10; 66:12,18; Jer